    "登入已取消。請檢查連線清單；取消不會撤銷已保存的連線。": {
      "comment": "native.aiSettingsView.loginCancelled. Application-owned text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登入已取消。請檢查連線清單；取消不會撤銷已保存的連線。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sign-in canceled. Check the connection list. Canceling does not revoke saved connections."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ログインをキャンセルしました。接続一覧を確認してください。キャンセルしても保存済みの接続は取り消されません。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "로그인을 취소했습니다. 연결 목록을 확인하세요. 취소해도 저장된 연결은 해제되지 않습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "साइन इन रद्द हुआ। कनेक्शन सूची जाँचें; रद्द करने से सहेजे गए कनेक्शन नहीं हटते।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inicio de sesión cancelado. Comprueba la lista de conexiones; cancelar no revoca las conexiones guardadas."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connexion annulée. Vérifiez la liste des connexions ; l’annulation ne révoque pas les connexions enregistrées."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Login cancelado. Verifique a lista de conexões; cancelar não revoga as conexões salvas."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proses masuk telah dibatalkan. Periksa daftar koneksi; pembatalan tidak mencabut koneksi yang telah disimpan."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Anmeldung abgebrochen. Prüfe die Verbindungsliste. Der Abbruch widerruft keine gespeicherten Verbindungen."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Đã hủy đăng nhập. Hãy kiểm tra danh sách kết nối; việc hủy không thu hồi các kết nối đã lưu."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Giriş iptal edildi. Bağlantı listesini kontrol edin; iptal işlemi kayıtlı bağlantıları kaldırmaz."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Nakansela ang pag-sign in. Suriin ang listahan ng koneksyon; hindi binabawi ng pagkansela ang mga na-save na koneksyon."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "ยกเลิกการลงชื่อเข้าใช้แล้ว โปรดตรวจสอบรายการการเชื่อมต่อ การยกเลิกจะไม่เพิกถอนการเชื่อมต่อที่บันทึกแล้ว"
