    "無法使用 Passkey。請確認 Associated Domains 與伺服器設定，或使用其他登入方式。": {
      "comment": "native.passkeyCoordinator.unavailable. Application-owned text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "無法使用 Passkey。請確認 Associated Domains 與伺服器設定，或使用其他登入方式。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkey is unavailable. Check Associated Domains and server settings, or use another sign-in method."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkeyを使用できません。Associated Domainsとサーバーの設定を確認するか、別のログイン方法を使用してください。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkey를 사용할 수 없습니다. Associated Domains와 서버 설정을 확인하거나 다른 로그인 방법을 사용하세요."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkey उपलब्ध नहीं है। Associated Domains और सर्वर सेटिंग जाँचें या साइन इन का दूसरा तरीका इस्तेमाल करें।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se puede usar Passkey. Comprueba Associated Domains y la configuración del servidor, o usa otro método de inicio de sesión."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkey est indisponible. Vérifiez Associated Domains et les paramètres du serveur, ou utilisez un autre mode de connexion."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Não é possível usar Passkey. Confira Associated Domains e as configurações do servidor ou use outro método de login."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkey tidak tersedia. Periksa Associated Domains dan pengaturan server, atau gunakan cara masuk lain."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Passkey ist nicht verfügbar. Prüfe Associated Domains und die Serverkonfiguration oder verwende eine andere Anmeldemethode."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
