    "請輸入 HTTPS 網站網址，不含路徑、帳密或查詢參數。本機開發可使用 http://localhost:17463。": {
      "comment": "native.apiError.invalidServer. Application-owned text.",
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "請輸入 HTTPS 網站網址，不含路徑、帳密或查詢參數。本機開發可使用 http://localhost:17463。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter an HTTPS website URL without a path, credentials, or query parameters. For local development, you can use http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "パス、認証情報、クエリパラメーターを含まないHTTPSのウェブサイトURLを入力してください。ローカル開発ではhttp://localhost:17463を使用できます。"
          }
        },
        "ko": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "경로, 계정 자격 증명 또는 쿼리 매개변수가 없는 HTTPS 웹사이트 URL을 입력하세요. 로컬 개발에는 http://localhost:17463을 사용할 수 있습니다."
          }
        },
        "hi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "HTTPS वेबसाइट का URL डालें, बिना पथ, खाते के नाम, पासवर्ड या क्वेरी पैरामीटर के। स्थानीय विकास के लिए http://localhost:17463 इस्तेमाल कर सकते हैं।"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Introduce una URL de sitio HTTPS sin ruta, credenciales ni parámetros de consulta. Para desarrollo local puedes usar http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Saisissez une URL de site HTTPS sans chemin, identifiants ni paramètres de requête. Pour le développement local, vous pouvez utiliser http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "pt": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Insira uma URL de site HTTPS sem caminho, credenciais ou parâmetros de consulta. Para desenvolvimento local, use http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "id": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masukkan URL situs HTTPS tanpa jalur, kredensial, atau parameter kueri. Untuk pengembangan lokal, gunakan http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Gib eine HTTPS-Website-URL ohne Pfad, Anmeldedaten oder Abfrageparameter ein. Für lokale Entwicklung ist http://localhost:17463 erlaubt."
          }
        },
        "vi": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Hãy nhập URL trang HTTPS không có đường dẫn, tên đăng nhập, mật khẩu hoặc tham số truy vấn. Phát triển cục bộ có thể dùng http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "tr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Yol, kullanıcı adı/parola veya sorgu parametresi içermeyen bir HTTPS site URL adresi girin. Yerel geliştirmede http://localhost:17463 kullanılabilir."
          }
        },
        "fil": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Maglagay ng HTTPS URL ng website na walang path, kredensyal o query parameter. Maaaring gamitin ang http://localhost:17463 para sa lokal na development."
          }
        },
        "th": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "โปรดป้อน URL เว็บไซต์ HTTPS โดยไม่มีเส้นทาง ชื่อบัญชี รหัสผ่าน หรือพารามิเตอร์การค้นหา สำหรับการพัฒนาในเครื่องใช้ http://localhost:17463 ได้"
          }
        },
        "it": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Inserisci un URL HTTPS del sito senza percorso, credenziali o parametri di query. Per lo sviluppo locale puoi usare http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "pl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Wpisz adres strony HTTPS bez ścieżki, danych logowania ani parametrów zapytania. W lokalnym środowisku programistycznym można użyć http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "ms": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Masukkan URL laman HTTPS tanpa laluan, kelayakan atau parameter pertanyaan. Untuk pembangunan setempat, gunakan http://localhost:17463."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Voer een HTTPS-website-URL in zonder pad, aanmeldgegevens of queryparameters. Voor lokale ontwikkeling kun je http://localhost:17463 gebruiken."
          }
        }
      }
    },
